{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>100% KOSHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(However, this game does contain flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iran has launched a missile attack at Israel and it is up to YOU to defend her! Use the mouse and keyboard to shoot down all enemy missiles and planes before the reach the city. If the city is still left standing, purchasable upgrades are offered to you in exchange for how many missiles you shot down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades included</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles with a larger blast radius</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles that can briefly stop time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruction of your city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A floating paddle that destroy any missiles in your cursor's way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bouncy ball that destroys any missile it comes into contact with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARE YOU READY TO DEFEND THE ONLY DEMOCRACY IN THE MIDDLE EAST?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021430?t=1769296260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021430/6609e684712fd1e290394da78c6980d21d546f58/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769296260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021430/789475a09320d8f8fd35c446dabbbf41b0cab906/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769296260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021430/789475a09320d8f8fd35c446dabbbf41b0cab906/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769296260","categories":[{"description":"